<title>USA: Dominick's Supermarkets Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Dominick's Supermarkets Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHLAKE, Ill. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollars in Millions (Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>				    13 Wks Ended    12 Wks Ended</p>
<p>				   Nov. 2, 1996    Oct. 28, 1995</p>
<p> Sales				    $611.4	    $544.6</p>
<p> Net loss				 (10.1)	     (1.3)</p>
<p> Shr loss				 (0.82)	    (0.18)</p>
<p> Avg shrs (in thousands)	    15,547	    15,579</p>
<p>Supplementary financial</p>
<p>information EBITDA</p>
<p> (as adjusted) (a)			34.0		27.6</p>
<p>				     53 Wks Ended  32 Wks Ended</p>
<p>				    Nov. 2, 1996  Oct. 28, 1996</p>
<p> Sales				   $2,512.0	$1,475.0</p>
<p> Net loss				   (7.0)	   (8.0)</p>
<p> Shr loss				  (0.96)	  (0.76)</p>
<p> Avg shrs (in thousands)	     15,571	  15,415</p>
<p>Supplementary financial</p>
<p>information EBITDA</p>
<p> (as adjusted) (a)			134.9	    71.6</p>
<p>(a) Represents income (loss) before interest expense, income taxes, depreciation and amortization, seller transaction expenses, SARs termination costs, net equipment write-offs related to closed stores and remodels, LIFO charges, restructuring charges, extraordinary loss on extinguishment of debt and cumulative effect of accounting change.</p>
<p>Share results reflect payment of preferred dividends.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 includes IPO charges of $6.3 million or $0.41/shr after taxes related to termination of a management consulting agreement and an after-tax extraordinary loss on early extinguishment of debt of $6.4 million, or $0.41/shr related to refinancing the company's bank credit facility.</p>
<p>	  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
